      "id": "deterministic-32-row-selection",
      "classification": "transformed-real",
      "description": "Keep HBA_HUMAN/27-137 first. For all other PF00042.29 rows with a UniProt accession, compute a query-centric normalization, require at least 70% non-gap coverage, deduplicate primary accession and normalized sequence, sort by source row ID, and select 31 rows at rounded evenly spaced ranks from 0 through N-1."
    },
    {
      "id": "query-centric-normalization",
      "classification": "transformed-real",
      "description": "Pfam full alignment dots are insert-state padding. Retain every source column where the P69905 query is not a dot, uppercase residue letters, and serialize dot/hyphen gaps as '-'. The ungapped query is exactly UniProt P69905 positions 27-137."
    },
    {
      "id": "source-column-aware-predicted-member-mapping",
      "classification": "transformed-real",
      "description": "For each retained candidate, use the frozen source Stockholm row to retain the UniProt position consumed by every real source residue, then project only the frozen query-centric columns. Mol* parses the local model and supplies label_seq_id/auth_seq_id/C-alpha coordinates. SIFTS is not used for any predicted member and this process makes no experimental mutation claim."
    },
    {
      "id": "frozen-alignment-column-rigid-transform",
      "classification": "transformed-real",
      "description": "For each mobile model, pair only ordered frozen PF00042 query-centric columns that have exact observed P69905/1A3N and mobile C-alpha mappings. Mol* MinimizeRmsd.compute calculates the deterministic mobile-to-1A3N transform. No automatic sequence or structure alignment is used."
    },
    {
      "id": "four-root-local-mvs",
      "classification": "verification",
      "description": "The checked MVSJ is one experimental 1A3N cartoon and three individually colored AlphaFold DB v6 predicted-model cartoons, all from local fixture URLs with frozen transforms and focus on experimental 1A3N chain A."
